# Graphify is a CODE-ONLY structural layer for this repo (see CLAUDE.md).
# Scope is deliberately just apps/backend/, apps/frontend/, scripts/ and tests/ —
# the SentinelScan codebase itself. The knowledge/ vault covers intent, history
# and prose; graphify must not duplicate it, and must never need an LLM to
# index this repo.
#
# Regenerate with:  graphify extract . --code-only --force
# NOT with `graphify update .` — update has no --code-only flag and simply
# re-extracts whatever the manifest already holds, so it cannot narrow scope.
# Verify after regenerating: the graph should contain no node whose source is
# a .md file or lives under .agents/, .claude/, docs/, knowledge/ or secrets/.

# --- The other memory layer -------------------------------------------------
knowledge/
knowledge/.obsidian/

# --- Prose specs ------------------------------------------------------------
# Authoritative, but documentation rather than structure.
docs/
*.md

